  </data>
  <data name="lblInstruction.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>DynamicStringLocalization is set to LocalScope for this form, meaning, every localizable text element is applied dynamically from a form-specific resource set, inlcuding this text. If you see a [T] prefix before the text, your Windows locale uses a non-English UI culture, and an untranslated resource set has just been generated for that language.

You see 3 user controls below, all have different DynamicStringLocalization settings. Feel free to change them after clicking their blank border area and see the changes.</value>
